---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About the Floor is Rising podcast and its hosts."
>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Floor is Rising is a long-running podcast about NFTs, crypto art, and the
      people building the space. The show ran from May 2021 through April 2023
      and produced 80 episodes interviewing artists, collectors, platform
      operators, and researchers across the field.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site preserves the show's archive. Episodes remain available via
      their original URLs and through the podcast RSS feed. New episodes are
      not currently scheduled.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Hosts:</strong> Sabretooth and Kizu.
    </p>
    <p class="muted small">
      Edit this page at <code>src/pages/about.astro</code>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
